 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K_fbLFrH7H8Q7kNvwFV53L1&_nc_oc=AdpyBcUt2WTZkZZqL9yfWBQbi6LyZdQ6rhRMRYzn6jgp_a_VHGTc0PenmzW_xnGgdnQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIlfzz-IQZzDZwCk8zV6fKa3g4ndp6Yn_ESFXpy50TAhw&oe=6A983E41"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nHxm9VdOVSMQ7kNvwF3_Vni&_nc_oc=Adp4O7GLRULdk2frHrgnWlFXd25lr53vZD2DyWpL0jt5aisOwhBPWfw07zQo8ZiWECg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIvQs7rNkC34oYz7znlQqr539Vr3KJYzv_sS1b_ZLKP3w&oe=6A984BA6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uFmnHjkaERMQ7kNvwHb78p6&_nc_oc=Adrg-qBjZUUjCz24349goMbEa49b37ezJyriD_ANA6ZkBNegU3YrYJ029XU5_ae_9PU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKabSqySc_SGUFZfC4dZ7N8WQbEsyPpVSw25DwypC6jAA&oe=6A98559C"}, {"fil